# Pairs with EventualConvergence. A full dead-letter queue evicts its oldest entry to admit a new one,
# as production's did before #4612 (the fix for #4603), so the evicted write is never applied.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceDeadLetterEvictsOldest
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a full dead-letter queue evicts its oldest entry, which is then never replayed
PERTURBS: ReceiveA
BOUNDS: NParts = 1, MaxDeadLetters = 2

--- FIND
             /\ Cardinality(dlq) < DlqCap
             /\ aack' = [aack EXCEPT ![p] = i]
             /\ dlq' = dlq \cup {e.h}
--- REPLACE
             \* MUTATION: evict the oldest entry at capacity.
             /\ aack' = [aack EXCEPT ![p] = i]
             /\ dlq' = (IF Cardinality(dlq) < DlqCap THEN dlq \cup {e.h} ELSE {e.h})
--- END
